    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Symbolic Cartographer's Eye.</strong> You don’t just see terrain—you see where the story is leaking out of it.</p><ul><li>You gain a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Perception (Mind)</strong> and <strong>Athletics (Violence)</strong> checks made to identify <strong>ley-lines, Spark resonances, and metaphysical hotspots</strong> in a hex or scene.</li><li>When you successfully map or scout a hex, the GM may reveal one additional <strong>symbolic or Tikkun-relevant detail</strong> (where Sparks might settle, where Qliphothic seepage is strongest, etc.).</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
